{
  "name": "Windows XP — in your browser",
  "short_name": "Windows XP",
  "description": "A complete Windows XP desktop in a single web page: Explorer, Notepad, Paint, Command Prompt, Minesweeper, Solitaire and more. No installation, no VM image, works offline once loaded.",
